    "q-182524": {
      "dom_id": "step-q182524",
      "name": "Question 16",
      "problem": "$¬(R⇔¬S)≡$",
      "worked_solution": "First, we use the definition of the biconditional statement to write the equivalence as a conjunction of implications: \n\n$$\n¬(R⇔¬S)≡¬[(R⇒¬S)∧(¬S⇒R)]\n$$\n\nNow, we represent all the implications using disjunctions and negations:\n\n$$\n¬[(R⇒¬S)∧(¬S⇒R)]≡¬[(¬R∨¬S)∧(¬¬S∨R)]\n$$\n\nNext, we simplify the double negations:\n\n$$\n¬[(¬R∨¬S)∧(¬¬S∨R)]≡¬[(¬R∨¬S)∧(S∨R)]\n$$\n\nNow, we use De Morgan's laws:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}¬[(¬R∨¬S)∧(S∨R)] & ≡¬(¬R∨¬S)∨¬(S∨R) \\\\  & ≡(¬¬R∧¬¬S)∨¬(S∨R)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we again simplify the double negations and write down symbols in alphabetic order inside the parentheses using commutative laws:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(¬¬R∧¬¬S)∨¬(S∨R) & ≡(R∧S)∨¬(S∨R) \\\\  & ≡(R∧S)∨¬(R∨S)\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-182524-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "(R∧S)∨¬(R∧S)",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"786\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D445 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2227\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D446 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2228\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cAC\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D445 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2227\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D446 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∨</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-182524-b",
