\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D446 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2228\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D445 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-sop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5D TEX-S1\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∧</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><mo>≡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∧</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Now, we use De Morgan's laws:\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"794\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 22.9e